<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <meta name="description" content="Portofolio Kiandra Rafa Adiyar – Pelajar SMA GUNUNG MADU." />
  <title>Kiandra Rafa Adiyar – Portofolio</title>

  <!-- Font & Icon -->
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css"/>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1de9b6, #1dc4e9);
      color: #fff;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    /* NAVBAR */
    nav {
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
      padding: 18px;
      text-align: center;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 1000;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    nav a {
      margin: 0 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #e0f7fa;
    }

    /* HEADER */
    header {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      animation: fadeDown 1s ease forwards;
    }

    .avatar {
      width: 160px;
      height: 160px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      transition: transform 0.3s;
    }

    .avatar:hover {
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }

    .avatar img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      opacity: 0.9;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    /* BUTTON */
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 20px;
      background: #1dc4e9;
      padding: 12px 30px;
      border-radius: 30px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      background: #159bbd;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .drive-anim {
      animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }

    /* MAIN */
    main {
      background: #fff;
      color: #333;
      border-top-left-radius: 40px;
      border-top-right-radius: 40px;
      padding: 60px 20px;
    }

    section {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto 60px auto;
      animation: fadeUp 1s ease forwards;
    }

    h2 {
      color: #1dc4e9;
      font-size: 1.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    /* TABLE STYLE */
    .table-wrapper {
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }

    th, td {
      padding: 16px 18px;
      text-align: left;
    }

    th {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1dc4e9, #1de9b6);
      color: #fff;
      width: 35%;
    }

    tr:nth-child(even) td {
      background: #f2fbfd;
    }

    tr:hover td {
      background: #e0f7fa;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    /* PRESTASI BADGE */
    .prestasi-table th, .prestasi-table td {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .badge {
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .gold { background: #ffb300; }
    .green { background: #1de9b6; }
    .blue { background: #1dc4e9; }

    /* FOOTER */
    footer {
      background: #1dc4e9;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      color: #fff;
    }

    /* ANIMATION */
    @keyframes fadeDown {
      from {opacity:0; transform: translateY(-30px);}
      to {opacity:1; transform: translateY(0);}
    }

    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from {opacity:0; transform: translateY(30px);}
      to {opacity:1; transform: translateY(0);}
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0% {box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(29,196,233,0.7);}
      70% {box-shadow: 0 0 0 20px rgba(29,196,233,0);}
      100% {box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(29,196,233,0);}
    }

    @media(max-width:600px){
      h1 {font-size:2rem;}
      h2 {font-size:1.5rem;}
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<nav>
  <a href="#tentang">Tentang</a>
  <a href="#biodata">Biodata</a>
  <a href="#prestasi">Prestasi</a>
  <a href="#kontak">Kontak</a>
</nav>

<header>
  <div class="avatar">
    <img src="kian.jpeg" alt="Kiandra Rafa Adiyar">
  </div>
  <h1>Kiandra Rafa Adiyar</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Pelajar SMA GUNUNG MADU</p>

  <a class="btn drive-anim" href="https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Zpw-jkam4kGb8K-Yc8TLIT3HMJ_MpLIq" target="_blank">
    📁 Lihat Google Drive
  </a>
</header>

<main>

<section id="tentang">
  <h2>📍 Tentang Saya</h2>
  <p>
    Saya Kiandra Rafa Adiyar, pelajar SMA Gunung Madu yang disiplin, kreatif, dan memiliki
    semangat belajar tinggi baik di bidang akademik maupun non-akademik.
  </p>
</section>

<section id="biodata">
  <h2>📄 Biodata</h2>
  <div class="table-wrapper">
    <table>
      <tr><th>Nama</th><td>Kiandra Rafa Adiyar</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Umur</th><td>17 Tahun</td></tr>
      <tr><th>TTL</th><td>Lampung Tengah, 15 Agustus 2008</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Jenis Kelamin</th><td>Laki-laki</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Hobi</th><td>Futsal, Badminton, Basket, Musik</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Alamat</th><td>Jl. Rahadian Yamin, Lampung Tengah</td></tr>
      <tr><th>Mapel Favorit</th><td>Biologi, Kimia, English</td></tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="prestasi">
  <h2>🏆 Prestasi dan Pencapaian</h2>
  <div class="table-wrapper">
    <table class="prestasi-table">
      <tr>
        <th>Prestasi</th>
        <th>Keterangan</th>
        <th>Tahun</th>
        <th>Status</th>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Juara 2 Futsal Pelajar Lampung</td>
        <td>Akademi Futsal Pelajar Lampung</td>
        <td>2023</td>
        <td><span class="badge gold">Juara</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Hafal 3 Juz Al-Qur'an</td>
        <td>SMP MBS</td>
        <td>2022</td>
        <td><span class="badge green">Akademik</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Seleksi Atletik Lampung Tengah</td>
        <td>Peserta Seleksi</td>
        <td>2023</td>
        <td><span class="badge blue">Peserta</span></td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="kontak">
  <h2>📞 Kontak</h2>
  <p>📱 Telepon: 0821-7685-0596</p>
  <p>📸 Instagram: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/kiandrarafaa" target="_blank">@kiandrarafaa</a></p>
  <a class="btn" href="https://www.instagram.com/kiandrarafaa" target="_blank">Hubungi via Instagram</a>
</section>

</main>

<footer>
  © 2025 Kiandra Rafa Adiyar. All rights reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
